msgstr "Osud"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fate can be used on a character to increase his chance to hit, or on a "
"monster to decrease its chance.  The chance is modified by 20 + 1 per point "
"of skill in Spirit Magic, and lasts until the target attacks, or 5 minutes "
"go by."
msgstr ""
"Osud může být použit na postavu ke zvýšení šance na zásah nebo na nestvůru "
"na snížení její šance na zásah. Hodnota je změněna o 20 + 1 bod za bod "
"dovednosti v magii ducha a trvá dokud cíl útočí nebo 5 minut."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "Bonus nebo postižení 20 + 1 bod za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "Bonus nebo postižení 20 + 2 bod za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 +4 per point of skill"
msgstr "Bonus nebo postižení 20 + 4 bod za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 6 per point of skill"
msgstr "Bonus nebo postižení 20 + 6 bod za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:350
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:450
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:449
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:254
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:354
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Turn Undead"
msgstr "Odvrácení nemrtvých"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead"
" runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus one minute per point of "
"skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""
"Přinutí všechny nemrtvé v dohledu k útěku během trvaní tohoto kouzla. Toto "
"kouzlo trvá 3 minuty za bod dovednosti v magii vzduchu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "Doba trvání 3 minuty + 1 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "Doba trvání 3 minuty + 3 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "Doba trvání 3 minuty + 5 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:351
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:451
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:450
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:251
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:351
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Remove Curse"
msgstr "Odstranění prokletí"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Rmv. Curse"
msgstr "Sejmutí kletby"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in "
"time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the "
"condition can have been present before the “point of no return” is reached."
"  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine "
"Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"Odstraní prokletí, pokud zakouzlíš toto kouzlo včas. Vyšší dovednost v magii"
" ducha umožňuje kouzlit kouzlo po delší době prokletí, dokud nebyl dosáhnut "
"\"bod, z kterého není návratu\". Poté už zbývá jen navštívit chrám."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""
"Funguje, pokud je postava prokletá méně než 1 hodinu za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je postava prokletá méně než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:236
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:352
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:452
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:236
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:451
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Preservation"
msgstr "Ochrana"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body. This will delay death "
"due to massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going "
"unconscious. If a preserved character's hit points are too low when the "
"spell wears off, he or she will die."
msgstr ""
"Ochrana mnohem pevněji připoutá duši k tělu. Toto oddálí smrt, když postava "
"ztratí mnoho zdraví, ale nezachrání před upadnutím do bezvědomí. Pokud je "
"zdraví chráněné postavy příliš nízké a kouzlo vyprchá, postava zemře."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works on entire party"
msgstr "Působí na celou družinu"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:443
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:353
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:453
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:443
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:452
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:57
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/GLOBAL.TXT.py:443
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:253
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:353
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heroism"
msgstr "Hrdinství"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + "
"1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic. This spell affects the entire "
"party at once."
msgstr ""
"Hrdinství zvyšuje zranění, které postava způsobí úspěšným útokem o 5 + 1 bod"
" za bod dovednosti magie ducha. Toto kouzlo působí na celou družinu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:354
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:454
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:453
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Spirit Lash"
msgstr "Bič ducha"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"This spell weakens the link between a target's body and soul, causing 10 + "
"2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic to all monsters near"
" the caster."
msgstr ""
"Toto kouzlo oslabí spojení mezi tělem cíle a jeho duší a způsobí tak 10 bodů"
" zranění + 2-8 bodů za bod dovednosti magie ducha. Působí na všechny "
"nestvůry poblíž sesílatele kouzla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:355
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:455
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:454
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:255
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:355
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Raise Dead"
msgstr "Vzkříšení mrtvého"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The "
"greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer a character can have "
"been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr ""
"Oživí postavu, pokud zakouzlíš toto kouzlo včas. Vyšší dovednost v magii "
"ducha umožňuje kouzlit kouzlo po delší době smrti, dokud nebyl dosáhnut "
"\"bod, z kterého není návratu\". Poté už zbývá jen navštívit chrám. Po "
"oživení bude postava slabá."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je postava mrtvá méně než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:356
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:456
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:455
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:256
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:356
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shared Life"
msgstr "Sdílený život"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it "
"amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and "
"3 extra points per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total. "
"Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual "
"character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit "
"points."
msgstr ""
"Sdílený život zkombinuje zdraví všech tvých postav  a rozdělí je zpět, jak "
"jen bude možné. K celkovému zdraví jsou přidány 3 body za bod dovednosti "
"magie ducha. Poté je zdraví rozděleno zpět postavám, ale žádná postava "
"nemůže získat více než je její maximální zdraví."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 3 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "Přidá 3 body zdraví za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 4 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "Přidá 4 body zdraví za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:357
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:457
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:61
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:356
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:456
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:257
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:357
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Resurrection"
msgstr "Vzkříšení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Resurrects a character whose body has been destroyed.  Recovery rate is very"
" slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit "
"Magic.  The resurrected character will be in a weak condition after this "
"spell is cast."
msgstr ""
"Vzkřísí postavu, která byla zahubena. Zotavení je velmi pomalé, ale "
"zrychluje se s vyšší zkušeností v magii ducha. Vzkříšená postava bude po "
"zakouzlení tohoto kouzla slabá."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:358
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:458
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:360
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:460
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Telepathy"
msgstr "Telepatie"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Caster reads the target's mind, finding out exactly how much gold and what "
"items the target has."
msgstr ""
"Sesílatel kouzla čte myšlenky oběti a dozví se, jaké předměty a kolik zlata "
"u sebe má."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:96
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:106
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate"
msgstr "Delší doba na zotavení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:359
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:459
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:357
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:457
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:259
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:359
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Remove Fear"
msgstr "Odstranění strachu"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in "
"time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition"
" can have been present before the spell no longer is effective.  After that,"
" the condition may only be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr ""
"Odstraní strach postavě, pokud kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší zkušenost v "
"magii mysli ti umožní kouzlit kouzlo po delší době strachu postavy, než se "
"kouzlo stane nefunkčním. Poté nezbývá nic jiného, než odpočinek nebo "
"návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud má postava strach méně než 3 minuty za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud má postava strach méně než 1 hodinu za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud má postava strach méně než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works no matter how much time has passed"
msgstr "Nezáleží na tom, jak dlouho má postava strach"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:360
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:460
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:359
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:459
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mind Resistance"
msgstr "Odolnost vůči Mysli"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mind Resist"
msgstr "Odolnost vůči Mysli"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Mind Magic damage by an amount "
"equal to your skill in Mind Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point "
"of skill."
msgstr ""
"Zvýší všem postavám odolnost proti kouzlům mysli o 1 za každý bod dovednosti"
" v magii mysli. Doba trvání je jednu hodinu za každý bod dovednosti."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:361
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:461
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:358
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:458
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:64
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:260
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:360
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mind Blast"
msgstr "Úder mysli"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of mental force which damages a single target's nervous system."
"  Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic."
msgstr ""
"Vyšle myšlenkový impuls, který poškodí nervový systém cíle. Myšlenkový úder "
"způsobí 3 body poškození + 1-3 body za bod dovednosti magie mysli."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:362
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:462
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:361
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:461
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:67
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:263
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:363
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Charm"
msgstr "Okouzlení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:67
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Calms a single targeted creature and removes any hostile feelings it has "
"towards your characters.  If this creature takes any damage, it will "
"immediately become hostile again."
msgstr ""
"Uklidní vybraného protivníka a odstraní všechny jeho nepřátelské pocity vůči"
" družině.  Jakmile nestvůra ztratí nějaký život, efekt kouzla pomine."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Spell lasts until party leaves the map target is in"
msgstr "Kouzlo trvá, dokud družina neopustí lokaci"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:363
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:463
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:362
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:462
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:262
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:362
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Paralysis"
msgstr "Vyléčení ochromení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure P-lyze"
msgstr "Odstr. ochr."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures paralysis if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and "
"rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been paralyzed before "
"the \"point of no return\" is reached.  After that, the only way to remove "
"the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí ochromení postavě, pokud toto kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší zkušenost "
"v magii mysli ti umožní kouzlo kouzlit po delší době ochromení postavy, "
"dokud nebyl dosáhnut \"bod, ze kterého není návratu\". Poté, již nezbývá nic"
" jiného než návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr ""
"Funguje, pokud je postava ochromená méně než 1 hodinu za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je postava ochromená méně než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Causes a single monster to go mad with battle lust, attacking the nearest "
"living creature until the spell wears off."
msgstr ""
"Způsobí, že nestvůra zešílí a bude útočit na nejbližší cíl, dokud kouzlo "
"nevyprchá."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration is 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "Doba trvání 1 hodina za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:365
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:465
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:364
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:464
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:70
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:264
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:364
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mass Fear"
msgstr "Hromadný strach"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"All creatures in the caster’s sight fear the caster and flee.  If a creature"
" takes damage while under the influence of this spell, the spell will be "
"broken. The duration of Mass Fear is 3 minutes per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic.  Mass Fear will not work on undead creatures. "
msgstr ""
"Všechny postavy v dohledu družiny začnou mít strach a začnou utíkat. Pokud "
"je nestvůra zraněna v průběhu účinků tohoto kouzla, kouzlo je přerušeno. "
"Doba trvání je 3 minuty za bod dovednosti magie mysli. Nefunguje na nemrtvé."
" "

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:366
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:466
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:365
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:465
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:266
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:366
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Insanity"
msgstr "Vyléčení šílenství"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Insane"
msgstr "Léčení šílenství"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures insanity if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and "
"rank in Mind Magic the longer the character can have been insane before the "
"“point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the "
"condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí šílenství postavě, pokud toto kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší zkušenost "
"v magii mysli ti umožní kouzlo kouzlit po delší době šílenství postavy, "
"dokud nebyl dosáhnut \"bod, ze kterého není návratu\". Poté, již nezbývá nic"
" jiného než návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if insane less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je postava šílená méně než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:367
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:467
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:366
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:466
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:267
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:367
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Psychic Shock"
msgstr "Psychický šok"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Psy - Shock"
msgstr "Psychický šok"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Similar to Mind Blast, Psychic Shock targets a single creature with mind "
"damaging magic--only it has a much greater effect.  Psychic Shock does 12 "
"points of damage plus 1-12 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""
"Podobně jako Mentální úder, psychický šok zasáhne samostatnou nestvůru, ale "
"s mnohem větším efektem. Způsobí 12 bodů zranění + 1-12 bodů za bod "
"dovednosti magie mysli."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:368
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:468
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:73
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:367
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:467
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Enslave"
msgstr "Zotročení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Takes control of target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill in Mind "
"Magic.  Enslaved creatures will fight monsters that are hostile to the "
"caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster "
"even if attacked by the caster or his friends.  This spell will not work on "
"the undead."
msgstr ""
"Převezme kontrolu nad myslí cíle na 10 minut za bod dovednosti magie mysli. "
"Zotročená nestvůra bude bojovat proti nestvůrám nepřátelským ke družině a "
"nebude bojovat proti družině, pokud ji nějaká tvá postava nezraní. Toto "
"kouzlo nepůsobí na nemrtvé."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:369
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:469
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:368
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:468
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:269
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:369
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Weakness"
msgstr "Vyléčení oslabení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Weak"
msgstr "Vyléčení oslabení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures the weak condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  "
"The greater the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can "
"have been weak before the spell will no longer work.  After that, the "
"condition may be removed by resting or at a temple."
msgstr ""
"Odstraní slabost postavy, pokud toto kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší úroveň v "
"magii těla ti umožní kouzlo kouzlit po delší době slabosti postavy. Poté, "
"již nezbývá nic jiného než odpočinek nebo návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if weak less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud slabost byla kratší než 3 minuty za bod zkušenosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if weak less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud slabost byla kratší než 1 hodina za bod zkušenosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if weak less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud slabost byla kratší než 1 den za bod zkušenosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:370
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:470
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:369
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:469
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heal"
msgstr "Léčení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures hit points on a single target when cast.  The number cured is equal to"
" 5 plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí zranění jedné postavy. Vyléčené zdraví je 5 + 2 body za bod "
"dovednosti v magii těla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "Léčí 5 bodů zdraví + 2 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures 5 hit points plus 3 per point of skill and can be cast on distant "
"targets"
msgstr "Léčí 5 bodů zdraví + 3 za bod dovednosti.  Účinkuje  i na dálku"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 4 per point of skill"
msgstr "Léčí 5 bodů zdraví + 4 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "Léčí 5 bodů zdraví + 5 za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:371
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:471
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:370
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:470
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Body Resistance"
msgstr "Odolnost vůči Tělu"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Body Resist"
msgstr "Odolnost vůči Tělu"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Increases all your characters’ resistance to Body Magic damage by an amount "
"equal to your skill in Body Magic. The protection lasts one hour per point "
"of skill."
msgstr ""
"Zvyšuje odolnost všech tvých postav proti kouzlům magie těla o množství "
"úměrné tvým bodům dovednosti magie těla. Efekt trvá hodinu za každý bod "
"dovednosti."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:372
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:472
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:371
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:471
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:78
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:272
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:372
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Harm"
msgstr "Zranění"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:78
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Directly inflicts magical damage upon a single creature.  Harm does 8 points"
" of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""
"Přímo způsobí magické zranění samostatné nestvůře. Zranění je 8 bodů + 1-2 "
"za bod dovednosti magie těla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:373
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:473
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:372
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:472
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Regeneration"
msgstr "Regenerace"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Gives the regeneration ability to a single character.  Regeneration will "
"slowly heal back hit points over time while the spell is active."
msgstr ""
"Přidá postavě schopnost regenerovat zdraví. Regenerace pomalu léčí zdraví po"
" dobu, kdy je toto kouzlo aktivní."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster hit point recovery rate"
msgstr "Rychlejší regenerace"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest hit point recovery rate"
msgstr "Nejrychlejší regenerace"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:374
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:474
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:473
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:80
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:274
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:374
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Poison"
msgstr "Léčení otravy"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures poison in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the"
" skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been "
"poisoned before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí otrávení jedem postavě, pokud toto kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší "
"úroveň magii těla ti umožní použít kouzlo po delší době otrávení  postavy, "
"dokud nebyl dosáhnut \"bod, ze kterého není návratu\". Poté, již nezbývá nic"
" jiného než návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:80
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if poisoned less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je otrava kratší než 1 hodina za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:80
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if poisoned less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je otrava kratší než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:231
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:375
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:475
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:231
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:374
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:474
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hammerhands"
msgstr "Kladivové pěsti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hammerhand"
msgstr "Kladivové pěsti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Hammerhands magically enhances the skill of an unarmed combatant, allowing "
"his strikes to land more precisely against an opponent's weak spots.  "
"Hammerhands-aided attacks inflict extra Body damage equal to the physical "
"damage caused by the unarmed attack."
msgstr ""
"Kladivové pěsti magicky zesílí dovednost v boji beze zbraně, umožňujíce "
"zasáhnout nestvůru mnohem přesněji na její slabá místa. Toto kouzlo způsobí "
"extra zranění magie těla, stejné jako by bylo fyzické zranění způsobené "
"útokem beze zbraně."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:376
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:476
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:375
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:475
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:82
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:276
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:376
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Disease"
msgstr "Vyléčení nemoci"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures disease in a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater "
"the skill and rank in Body Magic the longer the character can have been "
"diseased before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only "
"way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a "
"temple."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí nemoc postavě, pokud toto kouzlo zakouzlíš včas. Vyšší úroveň v magii"
" těla ti umožní kouzlo kouzlit po delší době nemoci postavy, dokud nebyl "
"dosáhnut \"bod, ze kterého není návratu\". Poté, již nezbývá nic jiného než "
"návštěva chrámu."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:82
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if diseased less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "Funguje, pokud je nemoc kratší než 1 den za bod dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:377
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:477
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:376
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:476
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:238
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:338
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Magic"
msgstr "Ochrana před magií"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Pro V. Magic"
msgstr "Ochran. mag."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Protection from Magic affects the entire party at once, granting immunity to"
" certain spells and monster abilities that cause debilitation conditions.  "
"These are:  Poison, Disease, Stone, Paralyze, and Weak.  Every time this "
"spell saves a character from an effect, it weakens.  The spell can survive 1"
" attack per point of skill in body magic--after that, Protection from Magic "
"is broken."
msgstr ""
"Odolnost proti magii působí na celou družinu a přidává jí imunitu proti "
"některým kouzlům a schopnostem nestvůr. Ty jsou: Jed, Nemoc, Zkamenění, "
"Ochromení a Slabost. Pokaždé, když kouzlo uchrání postavu, zeslábne. Kouzlo "
"vydrží 1 útok za bod dovednosti v magii těla, poté je kouzlo zrušeno."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants immunity to death and eradication effects"
msgstr "Zaručuje imunitu před efekty smrti a zahubení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:378
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:478
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:84
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:377
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:477
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:84
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:278
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:378
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:85
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Flying Fist"
msgstr "Letící pěst"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Flying Fist throws a heavy magical force at a single opponent that does 20 "
"points of damage plus 1-10 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""
"Splašená pěst uhodí samostatný cíl velikou magickou silou a způsobí 20 bodů "
"zranění + 1-10 bodů za bod dovednosti magie těla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:379
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:479
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:378
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:478
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:85
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:279
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:379
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:86
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Power Cure"
msgstr "Mocné léčení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Cures hit points of all characters in your party at once.  The number cured "
"is equal to 10 plus 5 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr ""
"Vyléčí zdraví celé tvé družiny najednou. Síla léčení je dána 10 + 5 bodů "
"zdraví za bod dovednosti v magii těla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:380
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:480
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:379
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:479
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:87
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Light Bolt"
msgstr "Světelná střela"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:87
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Fires a bolt of light at a single target that does 1-4 points of damage per "
"point of skill in light magic.  Damage vs. Undead is doubled."
msgstr ""
"Vystřelí světelnou střelu na samostatný cíl, která způsobí 1-4 body zranění "
"za bod dovednosti magie světla. Zranění způsobené proti nemrtvým je "
"zdvojnásobeno."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:381
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:481
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:380
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:480
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:88
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:284
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:384
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Destroy Undead"
msgstr "Zničení nemrtvých"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:88
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dest Undead"
msgstr "Zničení nemrtvých"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Calls upon the power of heaven to undo the evil magic that extends the lives"
" of the undead, inflicting 16 points of damage plus 1-16 per point of skill "
"in Light Magic upon a single, unlucky target.  This spell only works on the "
"undead."
msgstr ""
"Přivolá sílu nebes na zničení temné magie, která tvoří život nemrtvých a "
"způsobí samostatnému cíli 16 bodů zranění + 1-16 bodů za bod magie světla. "
"Toto kouzlo působí jen na nemrtvé."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:382
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:482
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:89
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:381
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:481
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:89
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:282
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:382
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:90
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dispel Magic"
msgstr "Rozptýlení magie"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Removes all spells on all creatures in the caster’s sight, both helpful and "
"harmful.  Recovery is reduced by an amount equal to skill in Light Magic."
msgstr ""
"Odstraní všechna kouzla na všech nestvůrách v dohledu družiny, jak pomocné "
"tak i zraňující. Zotavení závisí na zkušenosti v magii světla."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:383
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:483
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:90
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:382
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:482
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:90
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:288
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:388
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Paralyze"
msgstr "Ochromení"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:90
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Paralyze temporarily prevents a monster from moving or attacking for the "
"duration of this spell, which is 3 minutes per point of skill in Light "
"Magic.  You are free to attack your helpless target to your heart's content"
"--paralyzed monsters cannot retaliate."
msgstr ""
"Ochromení dočasně znemožní nestvůře se pohybovat nebo útočit během doby "
"trvání tohoto kouzla, která je 3 minuty za bod dovednosti v magii světla. Na"
" ochromené nestvůry můžeš útočit, ony nemohou útoky opětovat."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:384
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:484
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summon Wisp"
msgstr "Vyvolání bludičky"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summon"
msgstr "Vyvolání"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a Dancing Light to fight for the party.  It will stay until the "
"spell duration runs out or it is destroyed.  You can have no more than 1 "
"elemental summoned at once."
msgstr ""
"Přivolá Tančící světlo, aby bojovalo s družinou. Zůstane s tebou, dokud "
"kouzlo nevyprchá nebo dokud nebude zničeno. Kouzlem povoláš pouze jednu "
"Bludičku."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill.  1 Dancing Light maximum."
msgstr "Trvání 5 minut za bod dovednosti.  Max. 1 Tančící světlo."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Summons a Wisp.  Duration 15 minutes per point of skill. 3 Wisps maximum."
msgstr ""
"Přivolá Světlušku.  Trvání 15 minut za bod dovednosti. Max. 3 Světlušky."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a Will O' Wisp.  5 Will O' Wisps maximum."
msgstr "Přivolá Bludičku.  Max. 5 Bludiček."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:222
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:385
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:485
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/Global.txt.py:222
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:384
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:484
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:285
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:385
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day of the Gods"
msgstr "Den bohů"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day -o- Gods"
msgstr "Den bohů"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases all seven stats on all your characters by three times "
"your skill in Light Magic.  This spell lasts until you rest."
msgstr ""
"Dočasně zvýší všech sedm statistik všem postavám na trojnásobnou hodnotu "
"dovednosti v magii světla. Toto kouzlo přetrvá dokud nepůjdeš odpočívat."

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at three times skill"
msgstr "Všechna kouzla jsou seslána s trojnásobnou hodnotou dovednosti"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
