#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:129
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master instructor of the Staff, Elsie Pederton, can be found in the "
"Bracada Desert, on a ridge in the southwest region."
msgstr ""
"Mistr boje s holí, Elsie Pederton, žije v Brakadské poušti, na hřebeni v "
"jihozápadní části."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The ultimate teacher in the ways of the Staff, Jillian Mithrit, can be found"
" in the elven territory of Avlee.  Her home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr ""
"Velmistryně v používání hole Jillian Mithrit bydlí na elfím území v Avlee. "
"Její dům stojí v městečku na severovýchodě."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master instructor of the Sword, Tugor Slicer, maintains his residence in"
" a small village in the western region of Deyja."
msgstr ""
"Mistr meče Tugor Slicer má svůj dům v maličké osadě v západní části Deyje."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Sword, Chadric Townsaver, can be found in a small "
"village in Welnin, just south of the city of Harmondale."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr meče Chadric Townsaver se nachází v nevelké vísce Welnin přímo na "
"jih od města Harmondale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of the Dagger, Aznog Slasher, can be found in the northern "
"region of Nighon."
msgstr "Na mistra dýky Aznoga Slashera natrefíte na severu hory Nighon."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Dagger, Token Fist, can be found in city of Tidewater"
" in Tatalia.  Rumor has it that the Master Thief in the depths of the "
"Erathian Sewers beneath the capitol city of Steadwick can also instruct at "
"this level."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr na práci s dýkou Token Fist sídlí ve městě Tidewater v Tatalii. "
"Říká se také, že zlodějský mistr ve stokách pod Erathijskou metropolí je "
"taktéž s to vyučit vás tomuto umění."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master Instructor of all that is the Axe, Dalin Keenedge, can be found "
"in the northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr ""
"S mistrem sekyry Dalinem Keenedge se můžete setkat, vstoupíte-li do dveří "
"kdesi v severovýchodním koutě trpasličího Kamenného města."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The ultimate teacher of the uses of the Axe, Karn Stonecleaver, can be found"
" in the snowy heights of the northeast region of Tatalia."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr v práci se sekyrou je Karn Stonecleaver, jehož dům stojí ve "
"sněžných výšinách v severovýchodní části Tatalie."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master teacher, Claderin Silverpoint, can be found in the northeast "
"section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean Forest. "
"There he will further you knowledge of the Spear."
msgstr ""
"Mistr kopí Claderin Silverpoint se usadil na severovýchodě města Pierpoint v"
" elfím regionu v Tulareanském lese."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:138
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Spear, Selene Falconeye, makes her home in the "
"northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr ""
"Ze všech nejlépe vládne kopím velmistryně Seline Falconeye, která si "
"vybudovala domov na severovýchodě Kamenného města."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:139
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of the Bow, Lanshee Ravensight, lives in the northern "
"regions of Nighon."
msgstr ""
"Učitelkou mistrovství v ovládání luku se stala Lanshee Ravensight, která "
"žije kdesi na severu hory Nighon."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:140
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Bow, Cardric the Steady, can be found just to the "
"southeast of the castle in the city of Harmondale."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr luku Cardric the Steady žije ve městě nedaleko hradu Harmondale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:141
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master instructor of the Mace, Brother Rothham, can be found in the "
"southern region of the swamps of Tatalia."
msgstr ""
"Mistr palcátu, bratr Rotham, má svou skromnou chýši v jižní části blat v "
"Tatalii."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:142
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Mace, Patwin Felburn, teaches from his home in the "
"goblin village found in the eastern area of Deyja."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr palcátu Patwin Fellbern vyučuje této dovednosti ve svém domově v "
"gobliní vesnici na východě Deyje."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:143
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"My Master, Isram Gallowswell, can be found in the snowy heights of the "
"northeast area of Tatalia. You will gain further instruction in the Shield "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Obydlí mistra štítu Israma Gallowswella se skrývá ve sněžných výšinách na "
"severovýchodě Tatalie. Může tě naučit, jak lépe ovládat svůj štít."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:144
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Shield, Fedwin Smithson, can be found on the eastern "
"island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr štítu Fedwin Smithson se usadil na východním ostrově Evenmornských "
"ostrovů."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:145
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of Leather Armor, Rabisa Neldon, lives in the northern "
"regions of Nighon."
msgstr ""
"Mistryně kožené zbroje Rabisa Nedlon žije v nejsevernější části Nighonu."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:146
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Leather Armor, Miyon the Quick, can be found in the "
"eastern section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean "
"Forest."
msgstr ""
"Velmistrem kožené zbroje je Miyon the Quick, který přebývá ve východní části"
" elfího města Pierpoint v Tulareanském lese."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:147
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master instructor of uses of Chain Armor, Medwari Dragontracker, can be "
"found in the elven territory of Avlee.  His home is in the city in the "
"northeast."
msgstr ""
"Mistra v používání kroužkové zbroje Medwari Dragontracker můžeš najít na "
"elfím území v Avlee. Jeho domov je ve městě na severovýchodě."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:148
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster instructor of Chain Armor, Halian Nevermore, maintains his "
"residence in a large city in the northwest region of Deyja."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr kroužkové zbroje Halian Nevermore se usadil ve velkém městě na "
"severozápadě Deyje."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:149
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"My Master, Dekian Forgewright, makes his home in Erathia in the capitol city"
" of Steadwick. He can provide further instruction in the uses of Plate "
"Armor."
msgstr ""
"Mistr plátové zbroje Dekian Forgewright žije v malé vesničce na jihovýchod "
"od Steadwicku, hlavního města Erathie."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:150
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Plate Armor, Brand the Maker, can be found in the Bracada"
" desert, on a ridge in the central region."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr plátové zbroje Brand the Maker se usadil v Brakadské poušti, kdesi "
"na vršku v její střední části."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:151
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of Fire Magic, Ashen Temper, can be found in the city of "
"Harmondale near the stables."
msgstr ""
"Mistryně magie ohně Ashen Temper žije v Harmondale ve svém domě poblíž "
"stájí."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:152
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Fire Magic, Blayze, makes his home in Erathia in the "
"capitol city of Steadwick."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr magie ohně Blayze má svůj domek na samotě jižně od hlavního města "
"Erathie Steadwicku."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:153
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of Air Magic, Rislyn Greenstorm, lives in the elven "
"territory of Avlee.  His home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr ""
"Mistr magie vzduchu Rislyn Greenstorm žije na elfském území v Avlee. Jeho "
"dům najdete ve městě na severovýchodě."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:154
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Air Magic, Gayle, can be found in a tower in the Bracada "
"desert, on a ridge in the northern region."
msgstr ""
"Velmistryně magie vzduchu Gayle žije na severu Brakadské pouště ve vysoké "
"věži."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:155
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of the uses of Water Magic, Tobren Rainshield, lives in the"
" southwest region of Nighon."
msgstr ""
"Mistryně magie vody Tobren Rainshield žije v jihozápadní části Nighonu."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:156
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Water Magic, Torrent, lives on a ridge, south of "
"Harmondale, overlooking the city."
msgstr ""
"Velmistr magie vody Torrent má svůj domov na kopci jižně od Harmondale, "
"přímo nad městem."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:157
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Master tutor of Earth Magic, Lara Stonewright, makes her home in the "
"elven territory of the Tularean Forest.  Her residence is in the city of "
"Pierpont."
msgstr ""
"Mistryně magie země Lara Stonewright si zvolila za svůj domov elfské území v"
" Tulareanském lese. Její sídlo je ve městě Pierpont."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:158
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster instructor of Earth Magic, Avalanche, maintains his "
"residence in the western region of the Deyja."
msgstr "Velmistr magie země Avalanche se usadil v západní části Deyje."

