msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"A spell book.  To learn this spell, pick the book up and left-click over the"
" picture of your character in the inventory screen.  Your character must "
"know the Fire magic skill to learn this spell."
msgstr ""
"Kniha kouzel. Kouzlo se naučíš tak, že knihou klikneš levým tlačítkem na "
"postavu na obrazovce inventáře. Aby se postava kouzlo naučila, musí mít "
"dovednost magie ohně."

