#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid ""
"Grand Mastery of plate armor eliminates the penalty to your weapon's recovery caused by wearing armor.\n"
"I will teach you Grand Mastery of plate armor if you have reached a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 7000 gold."
msgstr ""
"Jako velmistr v plátové zbroji zcela odstraníš penalizaci ze zbraně za "
"nesenou zbroj. Velmistrem se staneš tehdy, pokud jsi již mistrem na 10. "
"úrovni a zaplatíš mi 7000 zlatých."

