#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:245
msgctxt "items"
msgid ""
"Increases temporary Endurance by three times the strength of the potion for "
"30 minutes per point of strength of the potion.  To drink, pick the potion "
"up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up "
